WEBVTT

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:14.160
You're such an earnest one.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.620
It's so kind of you to follow along
with humans like this.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:22.750
But you know, you may be able
to become human tomorrow.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.410
I prepared a toy that
may be able to kill you.

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:30.370
I do love the effort humans
go through in order to live.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:34.080
If they kill me, they will kill you, too.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.200
True.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.250
Why did you show humans your true self?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.330
What is your aim?

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:43.330
You'll understand everything tomorrow.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.370
Humans are egoists.

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:50.200
Helping humans that don't have anything
to do with you will only bring you misery.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.160
Why did you willingly choose a path
where they would call you monster?

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:57.500
Why do you still want to
become human, after all of that?

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.830
I want to live like a human.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:02.290
I want to wake up in the
morning and feel the sun.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:05.120
I want to cultivate the earth
and grow my daily bread,

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:08.830
ending the day thankful for food and life.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:12.080
Then, meet the morning again.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:15.370
That would get boring very quickly.

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:17.330
Have you grown bored?

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:21.450
There are only two things
I have not experienced yet.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:24.500
Giving birth and dying.

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:51.500
Is Officer Summers here?

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.120
No, I haven't seen her.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.910
Got anything?

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:09.580
They said there's a back-alley doctor
that offers abnormal body modifications.

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:14.410
Isn't that Dr. Recycle just an actor
that was hired by Felt?

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:17.160
I don't know if they're one and the same,

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:21.410
but someone who can turn humans
into water or vacuum cleaners

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.830
is worth looking into.

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:25.450
Are you sure about this?

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:27.250
About not going to the bridge?

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.040
Belo!

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:36.750
Let everyone go.

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:39.080
I will kill you first!

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.870
You monster!

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:48.580
I know.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.660
Harazy.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.200
No!

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:14.000
Dear citizens of Libra City.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.660
Yesterday, we proved to you
the dangers of humanoid monsters.

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:25.250
Even now, humanoid monsters
are living among us.

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:30.700
As a society, we must continue to fight
against the terrors of humanoid monsters.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:39.660
Take that.

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:41.450
Everyone should die.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.370
Run.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.370
No!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:47.910
Hey, Daryl!

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:48.790
Don't shoot!

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.410
Weren't you friends?!

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.330
Move!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.080
Do you all want to die?!

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.950
I won't die, even if you shoot me.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.910
But these kids will.

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:58.700
You'll become a murderer.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:03:59.950
Shut up!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:04.580
Nin... Ja.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:05.830
Belo!

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:09.830
Daryl, this is the guy
who murdered your father.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.200
Shoot him!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.330
Is he dead?

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:37.160
It's me, Harazy.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:38.660
Huh? Annie?

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:40.750
Is that you, Annie?

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.620
Sorry, my name isn't Annie.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.580
My real name is Bela.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:46.580
Bela...

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.160
Wow!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.290
You aren't scared?

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:52.250
Yeah. You should stay with me, Bela.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.330
They have everything here, so it's fun.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.370
No one is mean.

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:58.790
Were people mean outside?

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
Yeah...

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:07.290
This is really good. Did you show anyone?

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:10.910
Yeah, but no one said anything about it.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:14.120
I see. That's a little lonely.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.450
Yeah.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.700
Hey, why don't we go together?

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:21.410
There are a lot more fun things out there.

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:24.450
A lot probably happened. I know.

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:29.830
Me, too. Lots of mean things
happened to me, but I made friends.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:32.080
Do you think Harazy can make friends, too?

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:36.540
You can. I know a person who is very kind.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.000
You'll be fine.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.330
It's not scary?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:42.450
It's not. Let's try meeting her.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:44.950
Okay.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.370
Nin. Nin.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.410
Ja!

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.330
Nin!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.080
Ja...

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:07.910
Don't lay a hand on my friends!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.700
Why did you save me?

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.040
I tried to...

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.870
Don't make me say it twice.

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:25.200
Daryl, I'm going to disappear.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.040
So, stop doing things like this.

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:28.250
Belo.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.910
This is what I'm really like.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.660
Disgusting, right?

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.120
Belo is our friend.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.000
You should have just told us.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.200
I would have totally bragged!

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.040
Thanks.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:01.080
Great. We can eliminate all
humanoid monsters with this.

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:11.950
Citizens of Libra City. Humans will
win against humanoid monsters!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:17.000
We humans will never
accept such abominations!

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.370
This woman is a humanoid monster, too!

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:25.500
She is our enemy!

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:33.910
Wake up, Bem. There is no need
to go along with these humans.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.080
You monster...

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:46.040
It's been a long time
since I've heard those words.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.120
The execution was a failure.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:55.830
Let's head to the bridge!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:58.950
Huh?! What about that perverted doctor?!

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:02.950
I'm starting to think that
he may be at the scene.

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:07.450
You planned to play dead
and disappear, didn't you?

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:10.290
It is something the people
of this city wished for.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:11.500
So foolish.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.950
Did you know that he wouldn't die?!

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.160
He's a humanoid monster, after all.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:21.250
I am thankful for you, Felt.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:24.410
I was able to find my
successor because of you.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:29.410
ACES won't work. I have already tried.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.080
You tried?!

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:34.160
Only when the cells of the originals
come in contact with one another,

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.500
do I get a satisfactory result.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:39.250
A copy is still just a copy.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.620
Monster!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.580
What the hell is going on?!

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:11.620
Madame. Even if guns are useless against you,
we will never accept such monsters!

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:15.370
We will destroy all of you
humanoid monsters!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.200
He's still alive.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:28.790
Quite tough for a human.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:36.040
Humans always try to protect
themselves by destroying others.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:38.540
This has never changed.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.160
Don't hold back. Let us die together.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:07.750
Then, your wish will finally be fulfilled.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.330
Now I understand your aim.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:22.620
Come. I'm waiting.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:24.370
I will not fight you.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.700
No. You will.

00:10:27.700 --> 00:10:29.950
Isn't that what you want?

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:32.950
You want to die.

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:35.450
But only one of us dying is not enough.

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:39.080
You want the power created
by us dying together.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:42.290
That power that resonated when we touched.

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:44.330
Isn't it wonderful?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.830
Just like humans, I can die
and give birth to something.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:55.540
By killing each other, I will be able
to experience everything human.

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:59.620
It will be a power strong enough
to destroy this city.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:02.370
What will happen to the humans here?

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.500
You know, don't you?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:06.410
They will all die.

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.910
You bastard. You gave me
such a monstrous thing!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.500
Just as you expected.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:28.040
The perverted doctor is
fighting with his comrade.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:35.040
The death of humanoid monsters
will create a huge explosion!

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.410
Upper Town will disappear!

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.000
That's what I thought!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.580
What are you saying?

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:44.250
I miscalculated.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:47.540
A bullet made with ACES
wasn't good enough!

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.950
When real humanoid monsters
come in contact with each other,

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:54.790
the explosion of explosions will happen!

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:59.040
Humanoid monsters are terrifying monsters!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:02.160
This is an energy level similar
to a nuclear warhead...

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:04.620
Libra City will be wiped off the map.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.330
He's gone! Where the hell did he go?!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.370
No, Bem.

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:21.580
We can't die unless we come
in contact with each other.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:25.830
I will be able to obtain
everything human through death.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:29.330
I have already obtained
wealth, fame, and love.

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:32.290
Immortality is only fun in the beginning.

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:34.410
After that, there is only boredom.

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:37.000
Killing one another will destroy everything.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.290
It's fine.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.160
I'm the one who created this city.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:46.620
My ego, to destroy something that
I created, is very human-like, isn't it?

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:52.290
I will not refute the fact that their
egoism is a part of their humanity.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:56.950
Both the beautiful and ugly sides of humans
are what makes them what they are.

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:59.330
Why do you want to become
something like that?

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.450
Because I like humans.

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:06.750
If we continue fighting for and protecting
humans, we will one day become human.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.620
A city like this should just disappear.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:17.040
A filthy city that's ruled
by humanoid monsters!

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.160
Yes. It should disappear.

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:21.330
All of us, too.

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:24.080
I'm sick of Upper and Outside.

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:26.830
A bridge like this should disappear, too.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:29.250
We discriminate against
one another because of it,

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:32.120
and we don't even realize our own sinfulness!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:34.120
Go die on your own.

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:42.200
Hey, now. It's not good to get distracted.

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:43.450
Got all of that?

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:45.290
Every second.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:51.000
Hey!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.910
Can you take care of this child?

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:57.830
Hey, that little shorty...

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:00.290
I'll believe in you.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:03.080
Just like Bem believes in you.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:04.500
Thank you.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:09.870
It's fine. Go.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.250
This is for you.

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.750
You should eat it, Bela.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:14.870
I can't tell how it tastes.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.910
What? That's no fun.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:20.790
If I ever come to think it tastes
delicious, let's eat it together.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.120
Yeah.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:27.200
Promise me you won't use your powers.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:29.540
Everyone will be surprised.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:32.620
If you don't use it,
no one will be mean to you.

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.200
Yeah. I promise.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.910
Why? In front of us?

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:49.700
My friend told me I looked cool.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.290
This is her!

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.250
Beta. Such a cute little girl.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:22.750
You wanted to become human most of all.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:24.830
There is still a lot left I want to do!

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.700
I have no plans of dying here!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.870
I thought you didn't care, either way?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.830
I just don't want my friends to die.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:45.250
That reason is reason enough.

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.790
Even Gamma came.

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.950
You're smaller than I expected.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:53.700
You look older than I expected.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:57.120
I've lived much longer than you three.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:59.370
You're all finally here.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:01.370
I'm so happy to meet you.

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:03.410
I'm so happy, so...

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.160
I will kill you all.

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.160
I will make you all human.

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.910
Isn't she a little dangerous?

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:33.330
We can't let her leave this bridge.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:36.580
Don't let her catch you,
don't separate, and don't kiss her.

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.580
What?!

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.250
I definitely won't do the last thing.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:39.200
If you want to become human, do as I say!

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:13.750
She's too freaking strong!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:20.000
Why do you resist? Haven't you
seen enough of this world?

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.790
That woman is afraid of eternity.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:25.330
The things you say are complicated.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:29.620
She is alone, but I have the two of you.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:32.290
Are you trying to say we're like a family?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.790
Why not? Doesn't sound bad.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.410
Guess that's true.

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:39.200
We'll use this bridge.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.410
What are you doing?

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:03.120
We will not kill you.

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.160
We will sink you for all eternity.

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:21.120
They're protecting us.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.160
We won't let you have your way.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:32.410
Bem!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:34.870
I have something to protect.

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:36.160
Me, too.

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:37.580
Me, too!

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:43.250
What a human-like thing to say.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:59.040
Again, I am alone...

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.620
Everyone.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.910
Madame has become part of the past.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:14.580
However, the grooming of
her successor is going smoothly.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:16.330
It is a human this time.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:17.830
Please be at ease.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:33.450
You're looking at stuff like that again?

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.910
Are you planning to become a doctor?

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:41.160
You've been looking at that kind of thing
ever since Annie disappeared.

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.870
Her name isn't Annie. It's Bela.

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:48.120
Bela is still alive.

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:02.040
Welcome home, Sonia!

00:22:02.040 --> 00:22:04.200
I'm home, Harazy!

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.040
Were you good?

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:10.250
Yeah!
